==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*20 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Cli-One]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Gardeneel Bros.]] spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[R.Ost]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You want to use as many ranged attackers as possible. Cat Units such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]] are useful here. [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] are also incredibly useful here, as Supercat can be timed to block the Doge Base's waves, and both Bullet Train Cat and Awakened Bahamut Cat can be used as general purpose damage and such. Four meatshields and above are recommended for this stage.

